# A local .env holds the real DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY, council-adjacent secrets and
# SMTP credentials. The Dockerfile does COPY . ., so without this it lands in the
# build stage: it cannot reach the published image (only the static binary is
# copied out), but it is readable in the build cache and in any CI artifact or
# intermediate layer someone inspects.
.env
.env.*
